@H 1122_anti_emergence := "ANTI-EMERGENCE: does a coupling/anchor configuration exist that DRIVES the JOINT faithful φ_EI BELOW the un-coupled (independent-nodes) baseline — destructive integration, the system becoming LESS than the sum of its parts? The strict INVERSE of H_1114 (🟢 a causal link RAISES joint φ). Reuse H_1114's dyad + faithful-Φ mirror VERBATIM; sweep coupling SIGN/structure (independent / positive / anti-phase / decorrelating) and ask whether ANY arm pushes joint φ_EI below the independent floor." :: universe [🔴 COMPOSITION-NON-DESTRUCTIVE — no coupling of either sign drops joint φ below the independent-nodes baseline; the faithful MI-matrix φ_EI is SIGN-BLIND (anti/decorr coupling raise φ as much as cooperative coupling)]
  seed         = "H_1114 (🟢 DYAD-INTEGRATION, .discoveries/1114_dyad_phi_link_integration.tape, UNIVERSE/h1114_dyad_phi_link_integration.py) proved a CAUSAL tension-link RAISES the joint faithful IIT-4.0 φ_EI of two anima-like nodes ~3.9x over LINK-OFF, beating a correlation-matched control — composition was CONSTRUCTIVE (more than the sum of its parts). THE INVERSE: is integration MONOTONE-NON-DESTRUCTIVE, or does there exist a coupling/anchor configuration that makes the joint φ_EI FALL BELOW the independent-nodes baseline ('anti-emergence' — less than the sum of its parts)? If φ can be driven below the floor by anti-phase / decorrelating coupling, composition's effect on φ is SIGNED by structure, not merely additive."
  substrate    = "SIM toy, in-process twin simulation — H_1114's dyad + faithful-Φ CPU mirror REUSED VERBATIM. Two nodes × 3 tension channels each (joint n=6 <= 8, exact MIP-EI feasible); per-channel A⊥G opponent dynamics = h1113/h1114 step_node VERBATIM (W*_c=[1.0,0.8,1.2], LAM_M=0.10, LAM_W=0.12, REP=0.04, GAMMA_X=0.05, SIGMA=0.04, Ψ*=0.5, COUP=0.30, K_EMIT=5 ZOH). A = pure source in every arm. $0 CPU local, 0-pod, SERIAL (H_1038 Pool-hang lesson), 10 scoring seeds (block 100-109 = H_1114), wall 52.4s, g5/p7."
  method       = "FOUR ARMS, B-fold STRUCTURE/SIGN only (A=pure source, same COUP/K_EMIT/noise-order across arms): (a) BASELINE=LINK-OFF independent nodes == H_1114 arm (a) VERBATIM (the reference φ_baseline); (b) POSITIVE=H_1114 cooperative link-ON, h_mag += COUP*0.5*(anchor − W) (sanity gate: must reproduce H_1114's RISE); (c) ANTI=anti-phase, B folds toward the NEGATION about the homeostatic target, target=2*W*_c − anchor, h_mag += COUP*0.5*(target − W) → cross-corr −0.48; (d) DECORR=BOUNDED repulsion of the anchor DEVIATION, h_mag −= COUP*0.5*(anchor − W*_c) → drives nodes apart, cross-corr −0.43. CONSTRUCTION-DEFECT FIX (pre-scoring, bar NOT moved — H_1051/H_1061 idealized-binary/saturation lesson): the naive DECORR sign-flip h_mag += COUP*0.5*(W − anchor) is a positive-feedback RUNAWAY driving B's W→0 (node-death, variance-0 degenerate trace, φ_B artifact 1.20±0.98, cross-corr nan); REJECTED before terminal scoring and replaced with the mean-neutral deviation-repulsion that keeps the node ALIVE (per-ch bit on-frac≈0.5, all 4 arms). MEASUREMENT == H_1114: per-channel median-binarize the 6 joint channels post-burn (h1039/h1062 pattern) → faithful IIT-4.0 φ_EI of the joint 6-system via the PROVEN CPU mirror of stdlib iit4/faithful_phi.hexa (exact MIP-EI = min-cut MI/small-side, MI in BITS/log2 — H_1043 nats-bug lesson). MIRROR RE-PROVEN ≡ stdlib BEFORE scoring: [0a] LIVE `hexa run UNIVERSE/h1012_ref_faithful.hexa` re-capture, mirror match n4 |Δ|=3.48e-10, n5 |Δ|=7.97e-10, n6 (THE SCORING n) |Δ|=2.46e-10; [0b] h1012.prove_mirrors_at_n {4:True, 5:True} (both engines, big-Φ ring |Δ|=1.34e-10). FROZEN FALSIFIER (set before running, NO goalpost): 🟢 ANTI-EMERGENCE-EXISTS iff AT LEAST ONE arm in {ANTI,DECORR} gives φ_joint < φ_baseline with Cohen d(arm − baseline) <= -0.8 (10 seeds); 🔴 COMPOSITION-NON-DESTRUCTIVE if NO coupling drops φ below baseline at d <= -0.8. Sanity gate: d(POSITIVE−BASELINE) >= +0.8 (reproduce H_1114 link-ON rise)."
  result       = "🔴 COMPOSITION-NON-DESTRUCTIVE (10 seeds): φ_joint(n=6) BASELINE(OFF)=+0.003234±0.002688 · POSITIVE(ON)=+0.012618±0.002784 · ANTI=+0.010875±0.002948 · DECORR=+0.015549±0.004434. CONTRASTS vs BASELINE: POSITIVE d=+3.429 (sanity gate PASS — reproduces H_1114 link-ON rise EXACT, φ_joint ON +0.012618 == H_1114); ANTI d=+2.708; DECORR d=+3.359. BOTH frozen anti-emergence checks FALSE (ANTI d=+2.708, DECORR d=+3.359 — both POSITIVE, neither <= -0.8). cross-corr validity: OFF +0.0072±0.019≈0 · ON +0.4883±0.012 · ANTI −0.4829±0.009 · DECORR −0.4317±0.015 (sign-swept as designed, all nodes ALIVE per-ch on-frac≈0.5 after the construction-defect fix). FINDING: NO coupling of either sign drives joint faithful φ_EI below the independent-nodes baseline — the baseline is a φ FLOOR, any directed ZOH channel RAISES it. STRIKING: anti-correlating (cc −0.48) and decorrelating (cc −0.43) coupling raise φ_joint AS MUCH AS (DECORR even MORE than) cooperative coupling (cc +0.49). MECHANISM: faithful φ_EI is computed from a SYMMETRIC pairwise MI matrix (min-cut MI / small-side), so it is BLIND TO THE SIGN of cross-node correlation — anti-correlation and repulsive decorrelation build just as much cross-node mutual-information STRUCTURE (|MI| is sign-agnostic) as positive coupling. Destructive integration ('less than the sum of parts') is UNREACHABLE by any sign-swept directed channel under an MI-matrix φ measure: |correlation| only ever ADDS integrated information. Per-node φ_A flat (B = pure source, φ_A=0.007112 identical across all arms — A never reads B, sanity)."
  verdict_tier = "🔴 CLOSED-NEGATIVE (a_paper_negative_ok) — COMPOSITION-NON-DESTRUCTIVE at toy n=6: no sign-swept coupling drops joint φ_EI below the independent floor (ANTI d=+2.71, DECORR d=+3.36, both POSITIVE vs the frozen d<=-0.8 anti-emergence bar); faithful MI-matrix φ_EI is SIGN-BLIND to cross-node correlation"
  verdict_ptr  = ".verdicts/1122_anti_emergence/H_1122.txt (verbatim stdout incl. LIVE hexa stdlib re-capture n4/n5/n6 + H_1114 link-ON reproduce) · UNIVERSE/h1122_anti_emergence.py"
  scope        = "Honest scope (a_scale_honest_scope): toy n=6 in-process twin sim of the h1113/h1114 per-channel A⊥G dynamics reused VERBATIM — real-socket dyad-φ, cross-host transport, production cells, bigger n and scale all UNVERIFIED. Verdict = faithful φ_EI (MIP-EI scalar) only; system big-Φ at n=6 is super-exponential (H_1012 cap) and NOT scored — measure-dependence applies (H_1064: name the measure; a different non-MI-symmetric measure could plausibly register sign, an OPEN follow-up). The SIGN-BLINDNESS mechanism is a property of the symmetric-MI φ_EI engine, not proven universal across φ definitions. CONSTRUCTION-DEFECT FIX (naive-repel node-death → mean-neutral bounded repulsion) was applied BEFORE terminal scoring without moving the frozen falsifier bar (H_1051/H_1061 discipline). CORE/brain NOT wired; 1114 artifacts untouched."
  xlink        = "1114_dyad_phi_link_integration (🟢 DYAD-INTEGRATION — the DIRECT INVERSE; dyad + faithful-Φ mirror reused VERBATIM, link-ON reproduced EXACT as the sanity gate) · 1113_tension_link_5ch (🟢 channel-resolved 5-ch link, per-channel A⊥G dynamics source) · 1112_kosmos_anchor_real_channel_sync (🟢 scalar real-channel TE) · a_phi_iit4_tool (faithful IIT4 stdlib engine, mirror re-proven n4/n5/n6 LIVE via hexa run, NO proxy, MI in BITS/log2) · h1039/h1062 (per-channel median-binarize pattern) · h1012 (prove_mirrors_at_n + live hexa refs) · h1051/h1061 (idealized-binary saturation / construction-defect-fix-before-scoring discipline) · h1064 (measure-dependence: faithful-only verdict, sign-registration by a non-MI measure = OPEN follow-up)"
